    "text": "def is_multiply_prime(a):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns True if integer a is the product of exactly 3 distinct prime numbers\n    False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if a*a < 2:\n        return False\n    if a < 20:\n        return False\n    b = int(a ** 0.5)\n    if a/b % b == 1:\n        return False\n    if a % b == 0:\n        return False\n    return True\n\n    pass",
